        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeepBubbles was developed by a solo developer with a passion for cozy, relaxing games. Every fish, bubble, and feature was carefully crafted during countless nights of drawing, coding, testing, and fixing. This project is the result of patience, curiosity, and a deep love for underwater aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I sincerely hope this little world brings you a moment of peace in your day. Thank you for diving in. 🐠</p>",
